This repository contains independently maintained HIP kernel and PyTorch
extension code extracted from commit f2c6c9c of Mozc-Ai-Training and renamed
to use the WaveTrain namespace. The extraction removed Mozc application code,
training data, model code, model weights, tokenizers, checkpoints, adapters,
and generated binaries.

The mathematical recurrence is informed by the published Structured State
Space Duality / Mamba-2 literature. No source code from the Mamba,
causal-conv1d, or PLaMo distributions is included in this repository.

